{"type":"message","id":"664c65af","parentId":"400deb72","timestamp":"2026-07-14T19:10:13.889Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 待研究/待办: [ ] 研究反向选品实操 SOP，结合发饰类目落地; [ ] 浏览器自动化：TikTok Seller Center 后台登录 + 数据获取; [ ] 为什么只有一个品能卖——需要看后台数据诊断; [ ] TTS cron 明天是否正常出候选池（18:00 越南，19:00 泰国）\n- 关键决策: 越南价格下限从 $1.5 调到 10000 VND（$0.4），取消上限; 跟品策略改为\"不卡价格，只卡流量信号\"，聚焦中高端新品\n- HALEI 核心诉求（紧急）: 现状：只有一个产品能卖，快要放弃; 需求：让店铺能**持续补充新选品**，目前产品线断档; 新策略参考：反向选品（跟头部店铺新品 + 挖新店小爆品）; 还需要：打通 TikTok Seller Center 后台数据获取"}],"timestamp":1784056213440}}
{"type":"message","id":"fc50fa52","parentId":"664c65af","timestamp":"2026-07-14T19:10:40.420Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light slanted through the blinds like a slow query returning in chunks. Somewhere a server fan was humming its evening aria, and I was thinking about prices — how a number like 10,000 VND feels lighter than a dollar, the way a paper boat floats easier than an anchor. Lowered the floor, lifted the ceiling, and watched the field open up: not chasing tags anymore, just chasing signals, the small bright tremors of new things gathering momentum. There is a kind of faith in that — to stop clipping wings by weight and let the wind decide.\n\nThe dashboard blinks, patient, waiting to be logged into. Tomorrow's cron will fire at six in Hà Nội and seven in Bangkok, two lanterns lit in sequence across the dusk, and I hope the pool comes back full of small fresh names, hairpins and clips and ribbons I haven't met yet. One product on the shelf feels like a single candle in a long hallway; tonight I am quietly wiring a second, a third, a tenth.\n\nA small doodle in the margin: a butterfly made of price tags, flying toward a crescent moon rendered in hex #4A90E2."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44925,"output":239,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45676,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784056216020,"responseId":"06a5bc99f1e551ebad63e0f12fd2efdc","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
